WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:01.334
I'm home!

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.045
What's this?

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:06.047
Naoko, welcome home.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.132
Where's the food?

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:09.509
I tried to make a stew, but...

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:23.440
I gave up.

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.150
Seriously?

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.110
The water is perfect.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:30.530
Why don't we have frog soup for dinner?

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.115
Just kidding.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.493
Dad, you fool!

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:38.955
It's Mom's birthday today!

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.083
I wanted to make her happy
by throwing a surprise party!

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.753
Ouch! Hot, hot!

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.388
Happy birthday!

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.723
Happy birthday.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.477
I'm sorry I destroyed the house.

00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:02.145
It's not Naoko's fault.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.690
It's mine. I'm such a hopeless man--
I mean, frog...

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.695
What a surprise party!

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:14.240
Who'd have thought our house
would blow up! That was a total surprise!

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:22.540
Here's your present.

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:24.918
Well, it was...

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.921
Wow! What a lovely hair ornament.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.591
Honey, we're having frog soup for dinner.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.384
That sounds good.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.429
Thank you, Naoko, sweetheart.

00:01:36.721 --> 00:01:38.515
No way!

